  "factor_name": "120-day adaptive tail-resilience asymmetry",
  "version": "1.0",
  "calculation": {
    "expression": "rolling_mean_5((sum_40d_positive_returns - sum_40d_abs_negative_returns) / (sum_40d_positive_returns + sum_40d_abs_negative_returns)).shift(1) * sign(prior_120d_mean_cross_sectional_IC)",
    "description": "For each tradable asset, compute lagged 40-observation upside-minus-downside return asymmetry, smooth it over five observations, and multiply by the sign of the prior 120-observation mean daily cross-sectional IC. The IC regime sign uses only IC observations strictly before the signal date, with a 60-observation minimum warmup. Undefined ratios remain missing."
  },
